+Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit
+
+Adds the backend foundation for live file-status visibility:
+
+- statusBus.js: in-process EventEmitter with two channels (status,
+  session_file). Sized for ~100 concurrent SSE clients.
+- updatePathStatus(file_id, path, payload): wrapper around File.updateOne
+  that writes metadata.pathStatus.<path>.{state, reason?, chars?, chunks?,
+  completed_at} and emits to the bus. Best-effort; failures are logged but
+  never thrown — the upload path must not break on emit failure.
+- GET /api/files/status-stream: SSE handler scoped per-user via
+  event.userId, with optional ?conversationId= filter. Cleans up
+  listeners on req close/aborted to avoid leak. Defensive 401 if
+  req.user is absent.
+
+Tests: 13 unit tests across statusBus, updatePathStatus (mongo-memory),
+and statusStream (mock req/res). Cross-user-leak guard verified.
+
+Phase 2 Task 2 + 3.
